@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 회원가입 (성공)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test0707@example.com",
  "nickname": "김민정",
  "password": "password1234!",
  "image": "https://unsplash.com/ko/%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%84/%EB%A7%90%EC%9D%84-%ED%83%84-%EC%97%AC%EC%84%B1%EC%9D%B4-%ED%81%B0-%EC%82%AC%EC%95%94-%EB%A9%94%EC%82%AC%EB%A5%BC-%ED%96%A5%ED%95%B4-%EB%8B%AC%EB%A0%A4%EA%B0%91%EB%8B%88%EB%8B%A4-5IZn_sWzcrQ"
}

### 회원가입 (이메일 중복 -> 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "nickname": "다른닉네임",
  "password": "password123!"
}

### 회원가입 (유효성 검증 실패 -> 400, zod)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "nickname": "",
  "password": "short"
}

### 로그인 (성공)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signIn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test0707@example.com",
  "password": "password1234!"
}

### 로그인 (비밀번호 불일치 -> 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signIn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 로그인 (존재하지 않는 이메일 -> 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signIn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "no-such-user@example.com",
  "password": "password123!"
}